    "name": "Bem Schema Inference API",
    "description": "Infer JSON Schemas from uploaded documents using AI.\n\nUpload a file (PDF, image, spreadsheet, email, etc.) and receive a general-purpose JSON Schema\nthat captures the document's structure. The inferred schema can be used directly as the\n`outputSchema` when creating Extract functions.\n\nThe schema is designed to be broadly applicable to documents of the same type, not just\nthe specific file uploaded.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-22T02:02:48.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T02:02:48.000Z",
    "lastUpdatedBy": "35240",
    "uid": "35240-bd8111ef-258f-47bb-be29-362028c15e8f"
  },
